1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,836
Above Hiroshima, an atomic bomb exploded

2
00:00:02,982 --> 00:00:04,546
about six hundred meters off the

3
00:00:04,582 --> 00:00:06,691
ground. On August sixth,

4
00:00:06,764 --> 00:00:09,600
1945, an American plane dropped it

5
00:00:09,709 --> 00:00:10,982
over the Japanese city.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,800
The bomb fell for about three

7
00:00:12,946 --> 00:00:14,109
quarters of a minute.

8
00:00:14,327 --> 00:00:16,364
Then came a blinding flash.

9
00:00:16,727 --> 00:00:18,546
Heat and a blast wave struck

10
00:00:18,618 --> 00:00:20,618
the city. Fires began.

11
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,546
People died immediately,

12
00:00:22,618 --> 00:00:24,218
and later from injuries,

13
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:26,218
burns, and radiation exposure.

14
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,709
It was the first use of

15
00:00:27,746 --> 00:00:30,327
an atomic weapon against human beings.

16
00:00:30,618 --> 00:00:32,218
Just three quarters of a minute

17
00:00:32,291 --> 00:00:33,746
after the bomb was dropped,
